---
title: Steps 7 and 12 — Delete own booking (user) / any booking (admin)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as User or Admin
    participant P as protect
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant B as Booking model

    A->>P: DELETE /bookings/:id
    alt not logged in
        P-->>A: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>C: deleteBooking()
    C->>B: findOneAndUpdate(scope(req), {deletedAt: now})
    Note over C: user: {_id, user: me, deletedAt: null}<br/>admin: {_id, deletedAt: null}
    alt another user's booking (user) or not found
        C-->>A: 404 No booking with this id
    end
    C-->>A: 200 {data: {}}

    A->>P: GET /bookings/:id (same id)
    P->>C: getBooking()
    C->>B: findOne(scope(req))
    C-->>A: 404 deleted booking is no longer found
